WEBVTT

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:09.233
The start page shows how you are doing and what to do today.

00:00:09.283 --> 00:00:14.348
At the top: today's advice. Your AI coach decides the colour, the safety and the reasons; without valid advice the fixed rules give it, and say why.

00:00:14.398 --> 00:00:20.389
Under 'Why this advice': the reasons, where the advice comes from and where your AI coach and the rules differ.

00:00:20.439 --> 00:00:25.491
When new data comes in, like your check-in or a workout, your AI coach makes a new version. This line says when and why.

00:00:25.541 --> 00:00:30.042
When a second AI coach works with you, its second opinion is listed here. Where it differs from your AI coach, you see it at once. Your own AI coach has the last word.

00:00:30.092 --> 00:00:33.791
Update advice first syncs all your sources, then asks your AI coach for new advice.

00:00:33.841 --> 00:00:37.482
Recovery compares HRV, sleep and resting heart rate with your normal.

00:00:37.532 --> 00:00:47.647
Fill in the check-in every morning: 1 to 5 per question.

00:00:47.697 --> 00:00:56.683
Your answers are saved right away.

00:00:56.733 --> 00:01:00.783
A note helps your AI coach refine the advice.

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:06.516
Use ‹ and › or the date to move to other days.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:13.006
Further down: last night, body, timeline and best efforts.
